---

<section class="cta-final" id="cta">
  <div class="cta-final__bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="container cta-final__inner">
    <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--dark">Ready when you are</span>
    <h2>Ready to build outcomes, not just software?</h2>
    <p class="lead">
      A short discovery sprint, a growth target we agree together, and a
      measurable result to show for it. No hype, no jargon, no open-ended billing.
    </p>

    <div class="cta-final__buttons">
      <a href="/book-a-call" class="btn btn--accent btn--lg">
        Book a call
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m13 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg>
      </a>
      <a href="mailto:micah@talkcraftai.com" class="btn btn--ghost-dark btn--lg">Email micah@talkcraftai.com</a>
    </div>

    <ul class="cta-final__points">
      <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg> Works with the tools you already run</li>
      <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg> Fixed-price discovery</li>
      <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg> You own everything we build</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cta-final {
    position: relative;
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: #fff;
    padding-block: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 8rem);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* White primary button reads better on the orange band than orange-on-orange */
  .cta-final :global(.btn--accent) {
    background: #fff;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .cta-final :global(.btn--accent:hover) {
    background: #fff4ec;
  }

  .cta-final__bg {
    display: none;
  }

  .cta-final__inner {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 760px;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .cta-final h2 {
    color: #fff;
    margin: 1.25rem 0 1rem;
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 4.5vw, 3.5rem);
  }

  .cta-final .lead {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88);
  }

  .cta-final__buttons {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .cta-final__points {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 2.25rem 0 0;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88);
  }

  .cta-final__points li {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .cta-final__points svg {
    color: #fff;
  }
</style>
